aph_id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001","quote":"龕，僧辯婿也，始爲吳興太守，以陳武帝既非素貴，及爲之本郡，以法繩其宗門，無所縱舍。武帝銜之切齒。及僧辯敗，龕乃據吳興以拒之，頻敗陳文帝軍。龕好飲酒，終日恒醉，勇而無略，部將杜泰私通于文帝，説龕降文帝，龕然之。其妻王氏曰：「霸先讎隙如此，何可求和。」因出私財賞募，復大敗文帝軍。後杜泰降文帝，龕尚醉不覺，文帝遣人負出項王寺前斬之。王氏因截發出家，杜氏一門覆矣。","person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0086"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按本見證原職名及其所屬人。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001","text":"龕，僧辯婿也，始爲吳興太守，以陳武帝既非素貴，及爲之本郡，以法繩其宗門，無所縱舍。武帝銜之切齒。及僧辯敗，龕乃據吳興以拒之，頻敗陳文帝軍。龕好飲酒，終日恒醉，勇而無略，部將杜泰私通于文帝，説龕降文帝，龕然之。其妻王氏曰：「霸先讎隙如此，何可求和。」因出私財賞募，復大敗文帝軍。後杜泰降文帝，龕尚醉不覺，文帝遣人負出項王寺前斬之。王氏因截發出家，杜氏一門覆矣。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0000","surface":"龕","start":0,"end":1,"person_id":"sqi_qy6_6bu_ABA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0002","surface":"僧辯","start":2,"end":4,"person_id":"g7w_9tv_iqb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0049","surface":"僧辯","start":49,"end":51,"person_id":"g7w_9tv_iqb","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0053","surface":"龕","start":53,"end":54,"person_id":"sqi_qy6_6bu_ABA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0069","surface":"龕","start":69,"end":70,"person_id":"sqi_qy6_6bu_ABA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-064-dukan-wife-wang:p001:m0086","surface":"杜泰","start":86,"end":88,"person_id":"sdp_p72_67v","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provis